      },
      "lineNbr": 88,
      "author": {
        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-05-27T08:05:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Take option 2. I think option 1 have problem that it is hard to set \"X\" to clear the blacklist. Since this is conflict prefixes from upstream(we ensure downstream prefix length is 24 but upstream prefix length is decide by network), it is complicated to measure the \"X\" if prefixes length may be different.",
      "parentUuid": "ee30b89d_dda1c3d8",
